file caravan/ladder_checks.rye the lifted body, one comptime harness reached through the word rung
file caravan/recant.rye the three-line identity accessor that brought the thirty-seventh rung into the fold
file tools/fixtures/caravan_ladder_carry_scan.sh ceiling handed back 143000 -> 137300 in the same commit as the fold
file tools/caravan_ladder_carry_witness.rish pins moved with the measurement, and the queue's new head named
file caravan/README.md fold M's full accounting, and the meter's exact-text limit named for a later lap
file crux/REMEMBER.md live edge refilled, prior edge condensed to a cairned pointer, git nib pinned inside the send
file crux/CAIRNS.md the walk-back for the condensed fold-L edge, recorded before the sweep
recommend keep-going reckon_the_plan stands in 37 rungs at 75 lines apiece under one hash -- 2,700 carried, the largest standing. Behind it fill_table, reap_oldest, and settle_the_plan, whose reach this fold already widened and verified. Verify each reached symbol stands pub across all the rungs before a line moves, as every fold here has done.
